===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|gd|/eð/|a=Lewis|ref={{R:gd:Oftedal}}}}
* {{IPA|gd|/eɾʲ/|a=North Uist,Skye,Wester Ross|ref={{R:gd:MacPherson:1945}} !!! {{R:gd:TGSI:23}} !!! {{R:gd:Wentworth:2003}}}}
* {{IPA|gd|/ɛɾʲ/|/əɾʲ/|q1=preposition|/ɛɾʲ/|q3=3sg conjugation|a=South Uist|ref3={{R:Mac Gill-Fhinnein:1966}}}}
* {{IPA|gd|[əɾʲ~əʒ]|[æɾʲ~æʒ]|q1=preposition|q2=3sg conjugation|a=Barra|ref2={{R:gd:Borgstrom1937}}}}

===Etymology 1===
From a conflation of three {{inh|gd|sga|-}} prepositions:
# {{m|sga|ar|}}, {{m|sga|air||for}} (triggering lenition), from {{inh|gd|cel-pro|*ɸare||in front of}}, from {{inh|gd|ine-pro|*pr̥h₂i}}. Cognates include {{cog|grc|παρά||beside}} and {{cog|en|fore}}.
# {{m|sga|for||on}} (triggering no mutation), from {{inh|gd|cel-pro|*uɸer||over, on}} (compare {{cog|cy|ar}}, {{cog|br|war}}), from {{inh|gd|ine-pro|*upér}} (compare {{cog|la|super}}, {{cog|grc|ὑπέρ}}, {{cog|ang|ofer}}).
# {{m|sga|íar||after}} (triggering eclipsis), from {{inh|gd|cel-pro|*eɸirom||after, behind}}, from {{inh|gd|ine-pro|*h₁epi}}.
Cognates include {{cog|ga|ar}} and {{cog|gv|er}}.

====Preposition====
{{gd-prep|dat|-L}}

# [[on]], [[upon]]
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' bàrr a' bhalla|'''on''' top of the wall}}
#: {{uxi|gd|tha mi '''air''' an rathad|I'm '''on''' my way}}
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' m' fhacal, chan innis mi dhi|'''on''' my word, I will not tell her}}
#: {{uxi|gd|{{l|gd|beag air bheag|beag '''air''' bheag}}|little '''by''' little|lit=little '''on''' little}}
# [[in]] {{q|certain geographical contexts}}
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' a' {{l|gd|Gàidhealtachd|Ghàidhealtachd}}|'''in''' the Highlands}}
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' an dùthaich|'''in''' the countryside}}
# [[of]], [[concerning]]
#: {{uxi|gd|iomradh '''air''' do ghliocas|a report '''of''' thy wisdom}}
# [[by]]
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' ainm|'''by''' name}}
# [[from]]
#: {{uxi|gd|theich an duine '''orm'''|the man fled from me}}
# {{lb|gd|idiomatic}} {{n-g|Used to indicate inalienable possession, feelings and minor medical conditions}}
#: {{uxi|gd|dè an t-ainm a tha '''ort'''?|what's your name?|lit=what the name that is '''on you'''?}}
#: {{uxi|gd|tha an t-acras '''orm'''|I'm hungry|lit=the hunger is '''on me'''}}
#: {{uxi|gd|tha falt dubh '''orra'''|they have black hair|lit=black hair is '''on them'''}}
#: {{uxi|gd|tha an {{l|gd|cnatan}} '''oirre'''|she has a bad cold|lit=the cold is '''on her'''}}
# [[for]], [[on account of]], [[by means of]], [[through]], [[within]] {{q|triggers lenition}}
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' an adhbhar sin|'''for''' that reason}}
#: {{uxi|gd|'''air''' bheag de làithean|'''within''' a few days}}
# {{n-g|Used with a verbal noun to indicate a state}} {{q|triggers lenition}}
#: {{uxi|gd|bha mi '''air''' bhoil às dèidh dhomh siud fhaicinn|I was enraged after I saw that}}
